WEBVTT

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:00.530
she said, "Are you mad at me?"

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:04.297
"No. Why would I be mad at you?"

00:12:08.563 --> 00:12:10.763
"For wanting to move on,

00:12:10.763 --> 00:12:13.530
for wanting to go to heaven,
because it's my time?"

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:18.030
I looked her in the eye and I said,

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:19.730
"I'm really proud of you.

00:12:20.363 --> 00:12:22.397
I think you're brave.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:24.763
I think you're a designer like me."

00:12:25.663 --> 00:12:26.897
She perked up.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.430
She was like, "Oh, really?
You think I'm a designer?"